GROUND
Logical Ground Seqment sends commands to Command and 
    Data Handling (CDH) subsystem (i.e. host).

HOST
Host sends a payload command. 

PAYLOAD
Payload_X then sends a NACK message back.

HOST
Host recieves NACK message.
Resends the command and polls until recieves a message (POLLING IS AN ASSUMPTION).
    while(polling at 1Hz until break){
        if (Resend is unsuccessful){
            // Recieved a second NACK message
            execute_fault_response();
            break;
        }
    }
